  <ferc:DisclosureOfAssetsRetirementObligationsAROTextBlock id="HHFAE64936FDD456A2C12F0FE143F13EFB" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in;"&gt;4. On June 3, 2024, Texas Eastern filed its petition for approval of the Stipulation and Agreement (&amp;#8220;2024 Settlement&amp;#8221;) related to the May 3, 2024 prepackaged settlement, and on July 31, 2024, Texas Eastern received approval from the FERC of its uncontested rate settlement (&amp;#8220;July 2024 Order&amp;#8221;).&amp;#160; Pursuant to the July 2024 Order and terms of the 2024 Settlement, on September 3, 2024 and November 7, 2025, Texas Eastern filed actual tariff records reflecting rate effective dates of October 1, 2024 and January 1, 2026, respectively. Texas Eastern will continue to operate under those rates effective January 1, 2026.&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAssetsRetirementObligationsAROTextBlock>
