    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH58FC609B9FD7DE9B73F4CF553E70B602" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
All system balancing gas recorded under the fixed asset method as defined by FERC Order 581. Initial line pack is recorded in the plant account 117.1 (non-current). Any additional system gas volumes needed for load balancing, no notice transportation and other operational purposes is recorded in account 117.2 (current portion).</div>
    </link:footnote>
